WEBVTT

00:04:58.275 --> 00:05:01.018
Now, this next poem really changed

00:05:01.018 --> 00:05:03.014
what I liked and what I read

00:05:03.014 --> 00:05:05.373
and what I felt I could read as an adult.

00:05:05.373 --> 00:05:07.012
It might not make any sense to you

00:05:07.012 --> 00:05:10.942
if you haven't seen it before.

00:05:10.942 --> 00:05:13.150
"The Garden"

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.541
"Oleander: coral

00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:18.101
from lipstick ads in the 50's.

00:05:18.101 --> 00:05:21.069
Fruit of the tree of such knowledge

00:05:21.069 --> 00:05:23.013
To smack
(thin air)

00:05:23.013 --> 00:05:25.111
meaning kiss or hit.

00:05:25.111 --> 00:05:26.230
It appears

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.249
in the guise of outworn usages

00:05:28.249 --> 00:05:31.120
because we are bad?